 r←Test_Cleanup_018(debugFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;T2;rc;log
⍝ Exercise `Run` without any `Initial*` or `Cleanup*` functions: nothing must be reported about them
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 #.⎕SHADOW'Temp'
 'Temp'#.⎕NS''
 T2←⎕NEW ##.Tester2 #.Temp
 #.Temp.⎕FX'r←Test_Foo_01 x;⎕TRAP' 'r←0'
 #.Temp.⎕FX'r←Test_01 x;⎕TRAP' 'r←0'
 (rc log)←T2.Run 1
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 →T.PassesIf∨/'2 test cases of 2 called'⍷∊log
 →T.PassesIf~∨/'not found'⍷∊log
 →T.PassesIf~∨/'Looking for'⍷∊log
 →T.PassesIf~∨/'WARNING'⍷∊log

 r←T._OK
